	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "0.96 inch IPS TFT 80 x 160 with ST7735S: Wisevision N096-1608TBBIG11-H13, Midas MDT0096A2IS-SPI, Focus LCDs E096GA-SW500-N. Module 13.5 x 27.95 x 1.5 mm, flex tail with 13 contacts on 0.7 mm pitch folded back under the module and soldered to the board. Origin: centre of the module; the tail folds round the edge at +y. Seen from above with that edge at the bottom, contact 1 is on the right. Solder the tail first (its two holes over the two circles), cover the joints with polyimide tape, then fold the module over. The back of the module is a metal frame: no bare copper under it")
